ou have. Cut Through Noise, Focus on Real Risks AI based alert triage ​grounded in real cloud state.​ Stream’s AI triage prioritizes alerts​ using real time exploitability, blast radius,​ and behavioral context from the CloudTwin.​ eBPF runtime threat detection Detect exploits at the application layer, stop them before they spread. Detect threats using eBPF sourced telemetry accross Network, API, File and Process activity. Block known patterns, respond with AI when needed. Understand the Potential Impact Instantly Real-time exploitability potential and blast radius are automatically considered to prioritize every detection severity Every alert is enriched with real-time cloud context to instantly calculate risk and blast radius. Stream shows exactly what’s exposed and what can happen next. Raw telemetry flattens everything, so traditional tools can’t tell noise from real risk. ​ Set traps to detect the most advanced threat actors Canaries, The Force Multiplier for Early Breach Detection and Deception AI recommends the minimum number of canaries and optimizes their configuration to blend naturally into your environment. Tune Detection rules in seconds AI Exclusion Suggestions Every workload process is tied to its container, its cluster, its owner, and its baseline — automatically. Stream tracks what ran, what spawned it, and whether it's ever been seen before. Build your own rules with ease using AI Say what you want, AI will build it. Easily create precise detection rules without writing complex queries. Empower your team to tailor security policies to your environment in minutes. We wouldn’t believe it either. Get a demo What's new Blog Autonomous cloud Defense goes Kubernetes Petr Zuzanov Resources The Cloud Twin Case Study: Stateful Context as the Next Layer of SOC Intelligence All Resources > News CloudTwin expansion to your SaaS WAF perimeter Maor Idan No items found. Product Autonomous Prevention Autonomous Detection Autonomous Threat Hunting Autonomous Remedi